            "\\subsection{Multiple-Choice Sampling}\n",
            "We formulate the task as a 4-way multiple choice question, which is easy for evaluating the image-text matching performance and is feasible for human annotation. Specifically, a model is given a textual goal \\& four images to predict the most reasonable step towards the goal. We utilize three sampling strategies to obtain negative candidates:\n",
