            "                       & \\textbf{R@10}  & \\textbf{R@25}  & \\textbf{R@50}  & \\textbf{R@100} & \\textbf{Med r} \\\\ \\hline\n",
            "Random                 & 0.1  & 0.4  & 1.0  & 2.1  & 2519  \\\\\n",
            "DeViSE                 & 5.2  & 9.8  & 15.2 & 23.8 & 429   \\\\\n",
            "Similarity Net         & 5.8  & 11.5 & 17.6 & 27.0 & 347   \\\\\n",
            "Triplet Net (GloVe)    & 5.9  & 12.2 & 19.9 & 31.2 & 264   \\\\\n",
            "Triplet Net (BERT)     & \\textbf{6.9}  & \\textbf{13.8} & \\textbf{21.9} & \\textbf{32.7} & \\textbf{249}   \\\\ \\thickhline\n",
